  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_AFB8C763-5C13-4FA0-99B9-526A0D804754" name="tIncomeAssessments" isCollection="false">
    <dmn:description>Minimal local projection for PaLiheapCrisis. Reuse the canonical field meanings in BDT.dmn or Enrollment.dmn; only fields consumed by this model are included.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_9CFAF5C3-C13E-46F8-B28C-6BCC48B691F3" name="paLiheap" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>tIncomeAssessment</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_DA42DBD1-3F7B-48E5-A2D5-B336EC240BAB" name="tHousehold" isCollection="false">
    <dmn:description>Minimal local projection for PaLiheapCrisis. Reuse the canonical field meanings in BDT.dmn or Enrollment.dmn; only fields consumed by this model are included.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_2C2E4C42-CB1B-46AE-9CEA-9720B5F9CEBE" name="hasUsCitizen" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>Is anyone who lives in your household a U.S. citizen? Include children and people other than the person completing the screener. True means at least one citizen; false means none; missing/null means unsure. This establishes only the citizenship route, not complete member eligibility.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_A416930C-1452-4135-AE39-A07063391727" name="liheapNoncitizenStatuses" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>If needed, which of these immigration statuses apply to anyone in your household? Select all that apply. permanent-resident: green card holder; asylee: granted asylum; refugee: admitted as a refugee; paroled-at-least-one-year: parole granted for at least one year, not merely an application; withholding-of-deportation-or-removal: protection under INA 243(h) or 241(b)(3); conditional-entrant: conditional entry under INA 203(a)(7); cuban-haitian-entrant: Cuban/Haitian entrant; qualified-battered-noncitizen: qualified battered noncitizen under 8 U.S.C. 1641(c), including qualifying child/parent cases (abuse alone does not establish this status); iraqi-afghan-special-immigrant: Iraqi/Afghan special immigrant status; cofa-migrant: Compact of Free Association migrant born in Micronesia, the Marshall Islands or Palau. Choose other-or-unsure for an unlisted or uncertain status or unclear conditions. A missing list is unknown; [] explicitly means no listed or uncertain status applies. The screener may skip this question once a citizen is established. No names, documents or dates of entry are needed for this screen.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>tLiheapNoncitizenStatusList</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_00A25BA0-B0F3-439C-B063-D0876CA769C4" name="tHeating" isCollection="false">
    <dmn:description>Minimal local projection for PaLiheapCrisis. Reuse the canonical field meanings in BDT.dmn or Enrollment.dmn; only fields consumed by this model are included.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_FE0CFFC8-8EB0-45ED-A4BF-69A1A4DE2758" name="responsibleForSeparatePrimaryHeatingCosts" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>Is your household responsible for a bill, separate charge, designated heating portion of rent, or share of the cost of its main heating source? Include an obligation paid with outside help due to low income, even if the bill is in another name. Answer false when another person or agency has the permanent obligation regardless of household income. Missing or unsure means null.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_541B81AC-C0D8-42C6-B020-10F5E1A8479A" name="heatIncludedInRent" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>Does your rent or room payment include heat without a specific heating amount? Answer separately from responsibility for any separate heating bill or designated charge; both can be true. Missing or unsure means null.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_75A7F4DC-D800-40AA-9F33-18D462CD0314" name="responsibleForHeatingSystemElectricity" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>Is your household responsible for electricity needed, in addition to the main heating fuel, to operate its main heating system, such as an oil furnace motor? Include shared bills and payments through a landlord. This is secondary fuel, not a supplemental space heater or unrelated electric use. If electricity is the main heating fuel, record that bill under separate primary heating costs instead. Answer false if no separate operating electricity is needed or another party has the permanent payment obligation. Only used for Crisis; missing or unsure means null.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_2F9436A0-3084-4FFA-B5C3-366A0F3B6439" name="rentBasedOnIncome" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>Is the rent or room payment based on a fixed percentage of household income or on the source of income? Only needed for the undesignated heat-included-in-rent route. Missing or unsure means null.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_CABB52D7-348F-4A23-B058-A80FA4805276" name="equipmentBroken" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_0799D17F-DAC3-4134-A2D6-F6EA2ABF719B" name="fuelLinesLeaking" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_EC899E6C-EC72-489D-B202-3BD7519E1D9B" name="fuelDaysRemaining" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>number</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_CA9643AC-F146-4710-9731-5E365FD01BA6" name="heatingServiceDisconnected" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_0EC4B754-F04E-4251-8CC0-A2B3C527CCC0" name="terminationNotice" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_E8C12AF8-6DD6-4C52-BDEE-E2E31D067D84" name="daysUntilTermination" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>number</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_C589921C-55B9-4500-9D9C-092052C16B50" name="terminationPermitted" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_ACBD3AB6-B834-43EF-8357-3E8B38E1F3A4" name="crisisResolutionVerified" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_D91DC261-7E9C-4094-B641-C736ABCD17A2" name="tLiheapNoncitizenStatus" isCollection="false">
    <dmn:description>Self-reported immigration status listed in FY2027 Appendix B §601.31(4), or other-or-unsure. Categories requiring statutory conditions must not be inferred from a pending application, nationality or abuse alone; choose other-or-unsure if unclear.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:typeRef>string</dmn:typeRef>
    <dmn:allowedValues kie:constraintType="enumeration" id="_B78E388C-DD88-48C0-9E43-2718E030323B">
      <dmn:text>"permanent-resident", "asylee", "refugee", "paroled-at-least-one-year", "withholding-of-deportation-or-removal", "conditional-entrant", "cuban-haitian-entrant", "qualified-battered-noncitizen", "iraqi-afghan-special-immigrant", "cofa-migrant", "other-or-unsure"</dmn:text>
    </dmn:allowedValues>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_8A6DE17E-6E71-435C-9982-D8C4ED7691ED" name="tLiheapNoncitizenStatusList" isCollection="true">
    <dmn:description>Statuses applying to one or more household members. Missing is unknown; [] records that none of the listed or uncertain statuses apply. Known qualifying evidence takes precedence over other-or-unsure.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:typeRef>tLiheapNoncitizenStatus</dmn:typeRef>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:decisionService id="_DF621D67-7D07-421C-9C70-A7E3160F1BD0" name="PaLiheapCrisisService">
    <dmn:extensionElements />
    <dmn:variable id="_588A0A75-899D-41C4-901C-7E3D2D3C7086" name="PaLiheapCrisisService" typeRef="Benefits.tBenefitResponse" />
    <dmn:outputDecision href="#_81A9E856-333C-42F0-A9DE-3F8B23B00FEF" />
    <dmn:outputDecision href="#_3BD0EA05-9765-4EDC-BDEE-933302F8F1DB" />
    <dmn:inputData href="#_16AA10CA-CCED-454A-85E0-961329D7FA5D" />
  </dmn:decisionService>
  <dmn:decision id="_81A9E856-333C-42F0-A9DE-3F8B23B00FEF" name="checks">
    <dmn:description>Shares Pennsylvania residence, paLiheap income at/below 150% FPL, and citizenship/status checks with Cash. It permits qualifying secondary heating responsibility and additionally requires a verified resolvable emergency. Prior Cash receipt is neither required nor a disqualifier. Income preparation is the same paLiheap basis documented by PaLiheap and the final plan, not a separate Crisis income algorithm. The advertised 2026–27 season is 2026-11-02 through 2027-04-23. Household screening only: detailed individual member exclusions, dwelling, heating-appliance/code and unusual payment-arrangement requirements are deferred to the application process. The citizenship/status check does not establish complete member eligibility. Application windows, available funds, waitlists and provider scheduling do not change checks/isEligible. No award, account establishment or work approval is calculated. Policy review preserved from 2026-10-15. Named entries invoke reusable check Decision Services; inspect those models for their policy interpretation and input contract.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:extensionElements>
      <kie:attachment name="Pennsylvania DHS LIHEAP — program overview" url="https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dhs/resources/liheap" />
      <kie:attachment name="FY2027 LIHEAP final state plan — Appendix B, §§601.31, 601.41, 601.81–84" url="https://www.pa.gov/content/dam/copapwp-pagov/en/dhs/documents/services/assistance/documents/heating-assistance_liheap/2027-liheap-state-plan.pdf" />
    </dmn:extensionElements>
